WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:02.836
-The House has laid out

00:00:02.836 --> 00:00:04.971
the next steps in its
impeachment inquiry

00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:07.139
and now they're inviting
President Trump himself

00:00:07.139 --> 00:00:08.508
to participate.
For more on this,

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:10.176
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:10.176 --> 00:00:14.647
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.647 --> 00:00:16.182
One thing we know about Trump

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:19.018
is that his brain is basically
a toxic waste dump

00:00:19.018 --> 00:00:22.187
with a bunch of trash, debris
just floating around in there.

00:00:22.187 --> 00:00:24.724
And apparently, one particular
piece of brain litter

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:26.892
that got lodged
in his skull recently

00:00:26.892 --> 00:00:29.762
is an insane and completely
nonsensical idea

00:00:29.762 --> 00:00:31.164
that there are people out there

00:00:31.164 --> 00:00:33.532
who want to change the name
of Thanksgiving

00:00:33.532 --> 00:00:36.702
an idea he barfed up at one of
his group therapy sessions

00:00:36.702 --> 00:00:37.904
in Florida last night.

00:00:37.904 --> 00:00:40.873
-As we gather together for
Thanksgiving --

00:00:40.873 --> 00:00:42.441
You know, some people to change

00:00:42.441 --> 00:00:45.344
the name Thanksgiving.
They don't want to use

00:00:45.344 --> 00:00:47.547
the term Thanksgiving.
[ Crowd booing ]

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:50.483
And that was true, also,
with Christmas,

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:52.951
but now, everybody's using
Christmas again.

00:00:52.951 --> 00:00:54.187
Remember I said that?

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:58.691
[ Crowd cheering ]

00:00:58.691 --> 00:01:01.561
But now we're gonna have to do
a little work on Thanksgiving.

00:01:01.561 --> 00:01:02.828
People have different ideas

00:01:02.828 --> 00:01:04.697
why it shouldn't be called
Thanksgiving,

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:07.266
but everybody in this room I
know loves the name

00:01:07.266 --> 00:01:09.735
Thanksgiving, and we're not
changing it.

00:01:09.735 --> 00:01:12.972
-We could change it to "What the
[bleep] are you talking about?"

00:01:12.972 --> 00:01:15.641
[ Laughter ]
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:15.641 --> 00:01:20.413
Because nobody --

00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:24.717
nobody wants to change the name
of Thanksgiving!

00:01:24.717 --> 00:01:27.253
You see, as the impeachment
inquiry intensifies

00:01:27.253 --> 00:01:29.989
and Trump keeps losing,
he and his allies on Fox News

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:33.626
have to keep inventing insane
new paranoid conspiracy theories

00:01:33.626 --> 00:01:35.561
to whip up their base and keep
them in line.

00:01:35.561 --> 00:01:37.163
I mean,
first it was war on Christmas,

00:01:37.163 --> 00:01:38.998
now it's Thanksgiving.
What's next?

00:01:38.998 --> 00:01:40.966
[ As Trump ] The Democrats
don't want to use

00:01:40.966 --> 00:01:43.068
the term Halloween, folks!

00:01:43.068 --> 00:01:45.805
They want to change it
to All Gourds Day.

00:01:45.805 --> 00:01:47.140
We're not gonna let it."

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:49.509
[ Garbled speech ]

00:01:49.509 --> 00:01:51.077
[ Garbled speech continues ]

00:01:51.077 --> 00:01:53.245
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:53.245 --> 00:01:58.584
Now, you will not -- you will
not be surprised to learn

00:01:58.584 --> 00:02:00.753
that this dumb idea, like most
of Trump's dumb ideas,

00:02:00.753 --> 00:02:02.021
originated on Fox News.

00:02:02.021 --> 00:02:04.857
In fact, at one point, Fox
literally aired a segment

00:02:04.857 --> 00:02:06.658
with a giant graphic that said
the words,

00:02:06.658 --> 00:02:08.361
"War on Thanksgiving."

00:02:08.361 --> 00:02:11.898
There is no war on Thanksgiving.

00:02:11.898 --> 00:02:15.602
The only war on Thanksgiving
is the war between sane people

00:02:15.602 --> 00:02:19.372
and racist uncles who think
there's a war on Thanksgiving.

00:02:19.372 --> 00:02:22.542
And then after that war,
you have to have a second war

00:02:22.542 --> 00:02:25.078
between cousins fighting over
the last bottle of red wine.

00:02:25.078 --> 00:02:26.279
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:28.181
And then just to fully
illustrate the lifecycle

00:02:28.181 --> 00:02:29.915
of an insane right-wing
conspiracy theory,

00:02:29.915 --> 00:02:32.685
the war on Thanksgiving idea
traveled from Fox News

00:02:32.685 --> 00:02:35.421
to Trump's brain
and then back to Fox News.

00:02:35.421 --> 00:02:37.991
This morning, "Fox and Friends"
aired a clip of Trump's comments

00:02:37.991 --> 00:02:40.960
and then puzzled over where it
could've possibly come from.

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:42.461
-I don't think
there's a huge push

00:02:42.461 --> 00:02:43.829
to change the name of
Thanksgiving, is there?

00:02:43.829 --> 00:02:45.331
-Well, you know, uh...

00:02:45.331 --> 00:02:49.135
I think it was in 2015, there
was a rumor that Barack Obama

00:02:49.135 --> 00:02:52.037
wanted to change the name of
Thanksgiving,

00:02:52.037 --> 00:02:53.605
but that was debunked.

00:02:53.605 --> 00:02:54.974
-They actually did it.

00:02:54.974 --> 00:02:57.744
They found a way to tie it back
to Barack Obama.

00:02:57.744 --> 00:02:59.245
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.245 --> 00:03:00.646
I'm shocked
they didn't find a way

00:03:00.646 --> 00:03:03.449
to include Hillary Clinton, too.
In fact, I heard a rumor

00:03:03.449 --> 00:03:06.085
that one of Hillary's missing
e-mails had the subject line --

00:03:06.085 --> 00:03:08.087
"Secret Plan to Rename
Thanksgiving."

00:03:08.087 --> 00:03:10.957
So, I don't know.
It's hard to tell...

00:03:10.957 --> 00:03:13.059
[ Applause ]

00:03:13.059 --> 00:03:16.762
Trump is grasping at straws
and ridiculous lies

00:03:16.762 --> 00:03:19.031
because the impeachment inquiry
that threatens his presidency

00:03:19.031 --> 00:03:20.966
is intensifying and moving into
the next phase.

00:03:20.966 --> 00:03:23.102
Remember, we just had two weeks
of public hearings

00:03:23.102 --> 00:03:25.070
that featured
one witness after another

00:03:25.070 --> 00:03:26.639
testifying that there was,
in fact,

00:03:26.639 --> 00:03:28.540
a corrupt quid pro quo
with Ukraine.

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:30.243
We already have all the
evidence.

00:03:30.243 --> 00:03:32.478
Remember how they had to arrest
Al Capone for tax evasion

00:03:32.478 --> 00:03:34.247
because they couldn't get him on
the other crimes?

00:03:34.247 --> 00:03:35.815
Well, this is the exact opposite
of that.

00:03:35.815 --> 00:03:38.150
The President actually has
committed tax evasion.

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:39.685
Everyone's like,
"Oh, you don't forget!

00:03:39.685 --> 00:03:42.021
We don't have time for that!
The guy tried to get

00:03:42.021 --> 00:03:43.556
two countries to interfere
in our elections,

00:03:43.556 --> 00:03:45.758
he paid off a porn star, and
from the look of Rudy's face,

00:03:45.758 --> 00:03:48.928
he judo chopped his own lawyer's
ballsack.

00:03:48.928 --> 00:03:52.365
Now the House is laying out
its next steps

00:03:52.365 --> 00:03:54.800
for impeachment inquiry,
starting with a hearing schedule

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:56.603
for next week in the
House Judiciary Committee,

00:03:56.603 --> 00:03:59.939
which will be responsible for
drafting articles of impeachment

00:03:59.939 --> 00:04:02.741
against the President, which
means a vote on those articles

00:04:02.741 --> 00:04:04.143
could come by the end
of the year.

00:04:04.143 --> 00:04:06.211
-While Congress remains
on Thanksgiving break,

00:04:06.211 --> 00:04:08.915
Democrats are already preparing
for a busy December

00:04:08.915 --> 00:04:10.382
in the impeachment inquiry.

00:04:10.382 --> 00:04:13.486
Once lawmakers return, it is the
House Judiciary Committee

00:04:13.486 --> 00:04:15.020
that will take center stage.

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:17.890
Chairman Jerry Nadler writing
that on December 4th,

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:20.893
the panel will hold its first
hearing in the probe to, quote,

00:04:20.893 --> 00:04:23.495
"Discuss the historical
and constitutional basis

00:04:23.495 --> 00:04:24.630
of impeachment.

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:26.665
-December will be filled
with public hearings

00:04:26.665 --> 00:04:29.402
and a likely vote in the House
Judiciary Committee

00:04:29.402 --> 00:04:32.538
before a full vote to
impeachment on the House Floor,

00:04:32.538 --> 00:04:34.707
which could come before
Christmas day.

00:04:34.707 --> 00:04:39.011
-Wow, Trump could actually be
impeached in time for Christmas.

00:04:39.011 --> 00:04:41.914
I mean, in a way, it's the one
promise he's actually kept

00:04:41.914 --> 00:04:43.582
because remember, he did say...

00:04:43.582 --> 00:04:46.652
-You'll be saying,
"Merry Christmas" again.

00:04:46.652 --> 00:04:48.020
-See, he was right!

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:50.589
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:50.589 --> 00:04:54.693
Now, in announcing
this next step,

00:04:54.693 --> 00:04:56.462
the House also invited Trump
and his lawyers

00:04:56.462 --> 00:04:58.130
to participate in the
impeachment process,

00:04:58.130 --> 00:05:00.832
but in doing so, they laid out
what would seem like

00:05:00.832 --> 00:05:02.568
a pretty obvious rule.

00:05:02.568 --> 00:05:05.304
House Judiciary Chairman
Jerry Nadler wrote to Trump,

00:05:05.304 --> 00:05:08.374
"I am hopeful that you and your
council will opt to participate

00:05:08.374 --> 00:05:09.609
in the committee's hearings

00:05:09.609 --> 00:05:11.711
consistent with the rules
of decorum

00:05:11.711 --> 00:05:13.846
and with the solemn nature
before us."

00:05:13.846 --> 00:05:15.881
It's amazing that they even had
to tell the President

00:05:15.881 --> 00:05:17.783
to adhere to the rules
of decorum.

00:05:17.783 --> 00:05:19.585
But it's like how you have one
wedding invitation

00:05:19.585 --> 00:05:21.320
for all of your guests
and then another one

00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:23.089
just for your druggy cousin.

00:05:23.089 --> 00:05:24.824
[ Laughter ]

00:05:24.824 --> 00:05:27.259
Now, a CNN poll this week found
that 50% of Americans

00:05:27.259 --> 00:05:29.561
want Trump not just impeached
but removed from office,

00:05:29.561 --> 00:05:32.732
and the House's invitation
to Trump comes after weeks

00:05:32.732 --> 00:05:35.467
of Trump complaining that he
wasn't allowed to participate

00:05:35.467 --> 00:05:37.536
in the impeachment process.
In fact, last week

00:05:37.536 --> 00:05:39.104
in a rambling Fox News
interview,

00:05:39.104 --> 00:05:41.507
he even said he would welcome
a trial in the Senate,

00:05:41.507 --> 00:05:43.576
which would likely begin
early next year.

00:05:43.576 --> 00:05:45.378
-Don't forget,
there was no due process,

00:05:45.378 --> 00:05:48.147
you can't have lawyers, we
couldn't have any witnesses.

00:05:48.147 --> 00:05:49.748
We want to call
the whistleblower.

00:05:49.748 --> 00:05:51.684
But you know who I want
as the first witness?

00:05:51.684 --> 00:05:54.019
'Cause, frankly, I want a trial.

00:05:54.019 --> 00:05:56.355
-No! You do not want a trial.

00:05:56.355 --> 00:05:58.791
You wouldn't last more
than five minutes on the stand

00:05:58.791 --> 00:06:00.526
without confessing.
For one thing,

00:06:00.526 --> 00:06:03.562
your arresting demeanor is,
"You're damn right I ordered

00:06:03.562 --> 00:06:04.664
the code red."

00:06:04.664 --> 00:06:05.932
[ Laughter ]

00:06:05.932 --> 00:06:07.399
So now that
the impeachment inquiry

00:06:07.399 --> 00:06:09.768
is moving to its next phase,
Trump is preparing his defense.

00:06:09.768 --> 00:06:12.271
For example, he's blocked
several of his closest aids

00:06:12.271 --> 00:06:14.873
from testifying -- aids who have
been directly implicated

00:06:14.873 --> 00:06:16.675
in this scheme to extort
Ukraine.

00:06:16.675 --> 00:06:18.811
In fact, at this very moment,
Trump's White House

00:06:18.811 --> 00:06:21.547
is fighting in court to block
those aids from testifying.

00:06:21.547 --> 00:06:23.916
But yesterday, Trump insisted
he's actually love

00:06:23.916 --> 00:06:25.551
to let them tell their side
of the story.

00:06:25.551 --> 00:06:29.221
-Trump tweeted, "I would love to
have Mike Pompeo, Rick Perry,

00:06:29.221 --> 00:06:31.791
Mick Mulvaney,
and many others testify

00:06:31.791 --> 00:06:33.792
about the phoney
impeachment hoax.

00:06:33.792 --> 00:06:36.896
-Oh, would you? Would you love
for them to testify?

00:06:36.896 --> 00:06:39.765
He always goes so overboard and
makes it clear that he's lying.

00:06:39.765 --> 00:06:42.134
That's like if your girlfriend
said, "I'd love to stay in

00:06:42.134 --> 00:06:44.269
on a Friday night and watch you
play video games."

00:06:44.269 --> 00:06:46.138
You'd be like, "Nuh-uh!"

00:06:46.138 --> 00:06:47.773
[ Laughter ]

00:06:47.773 --> 00:06:49.107
So Trump inner circle

00:06:49.107 --> 00:06:51.343
has been dragged into the
impeachment process, as well.

00:06:51.343 --> 00:06:54.079
Now, it's well established that
America's greatest Presidents

00:06:54.079 --> 00:06:57.216
have always succeeded in part
by assembling great teams.

00:06:57.216 --> 00:07:00.552
FDR had his famous Brain Trust,
Lincoln had his team of rivals,

00:07:00.552 --> 00:07:01.987
and Trump, of course,
has his team

00:07:01.987 --> 00:07:04.122
of off-brand
Mr. Potato Head dolls.

00:07:04.122 --> 00:07:05.892
[ Laughter ]
I mean, look at --

00:07:05.892 --> 00:07:08.060
Why do they all look like
their eyes and ears

00:07:08.060 --> 00:07:09.328
have been drawn onto their
heads?

00:07:09.328 --> 00:07:11.097
I mean, Stephen Miller
looks like

00:07:11.097 --> 00:07:13.098
a snake just rose
out of a basket,

00:07:13.098 --> 00:07:15.500
Devin Nunes looks like
someone poked two holes

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:17.703
in a brown paper bag,

00:07:17.703 --> 00:07:21.774
Rudy Giuliani looks like
a face drawn on a kumquat.

00:07:21.774 --> 00:07:26.745
And now, Trump's inner circle is
entangled in his criminal scheme

00:07:26.745 --> 00:07:29.448
to extort a foreign country to
interfere in the 2020 election.

00:07:29.448 --> 00:07:31.450
For example, today
the "New York Times" reported

00:07:31.450 --> 00:07:34.053
that Giuliani, who is reportedly
on a criminal investigation

00:07:34.053 --> 00:07:35.454
for everything from money
laundering

00:07:35.454 --> 00:07:37.757
to obstruction of justice to
campaign finance violations,

00:07:37.757 --> 00:07:40.292
also pursued business in Ukraine

00:07:40.292 --> 00:07:41.761
while pushing for inquiries
for Trump.

00:07:41.761 --> 00:07:44.897
And it wasn't just Rudy.
Two of Giuliani's henchmen,

00:07:44.897 --> 00:07:48.701
Lev Parnas and Igor Fruman,
have already been indicted

00:07:48.701 --> 00:07:51.604
for their role in this scheme.
You remember these two guys?

00:07:51.604 --> 00:07:53.372
The guys who look like
characters

00:07:53.372 --> 00:07:55.007
from the Soviet version
of Guess Who?

00:07:55.007 --> 00:07:57.243
[ Laughter ]

00:07:57.243 --> 00:08:00.846
Now, you might remember that
these guys had at least 10 --

00:08:00.846 --> 00:08:03.182
10 separate interactions
with Trump.

00:08:03.182 --> 00:08:05.718
And they told associates that
Trump had sent them

00:08:05.718 --> 00:08:08.788
on a secret mission to dig up
dirt on Joe Biden and Ukraine.

00:08:08.788 --> 00:08:11.156
I'm sorry, but these
are the guys you want

00:08:11.156 --> 00:08:13.058
on a secret mission?
Yeah, I mean,

00:08:13.058 --> 00:08:15.227
they'll blend right in
as long as the mission

00:08:15.227 --> 00:08:18.464
is to infiltrate a convention
of Queens building supers.

00:08:18.464 --> 00:08:20.465
[ Laughter ]

00:08:20.465 --> 00:08:22.434
In fact, they specifically said
they'd been given

00:08:22.434 --> 00:08:25.004
a special assignment by Trump,
which they told people

00:08:25.004 --> 00:08:26.606
was some sort of James Bond
mission.

00:08:26.606 --> 00:08:28.273
It's really great that Trump
came up

00:08:28.273 --> 00:08:31.143
with a James Bond mission
and he assigned it to two guys

00:08:31.143 --> 00:08:33.879
who look like they'd immediately
get thrown off a speedboat

00:08:33.879 --> 00:08:35.848
by James Bond.

00:08:35.848 --> 00:08:37.949
These guys look like
the mug shots that would come up

00:08:37.949 --> 00:08:39.485
during one of Bond's briefings.

00:08:39.485 --> 00:08:41.086
You know, like at the beginning
of the movie

00:08:41.086 --> 00:08:43.456
when M is going through a list
of known suspects

00:08:43.456 --> 00:08:44.790
before they get to
the main villain.

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:47.192
It's like, "[British accent]
Lev Parnas -- arms dealer

00:08:47.192 --> 00:08:49.694
eaten by a shark
in the South Pacific.

00:08:49.694 --> 00:08:52.999
Igor Fruman -- drug trafficker
accidentally electrocuted

00:08:52.999 --> 00:08:55.401
after putting his [bleep]
in a socket in Kiev.

00:08:55.401 --> 00:08:59.438
[ Laughter ]

00:08:59.438 --> 00:09:01.640
That's the photo from before
that happened."

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:02.841
[ Laughter ]

00:09:02.841 --> 00:09:05.143
Now -- Now they've been
arrested,

00:09:05.143 --> 00:09:06.845
one of them
is basically begging to flip

00:09:06.845 --> 00:09:08.113
on Rudy and the President,

00:09:08.113 --> 00:09:09.415
and the House Intelligence
Committee

00:09:09.415 --> 00:09:11.817
is reportedly already
in possession

00:09:11.817 --> 00:09:14.186
of audio and video recordings
and photographs

00:09:14.186 --> 00:09:15.888
provided to the committee
by Lev Parnas.

00:09:15.888 --> 00:09:17.323
The material submitted
to the committee includes

00:09:17.323 --> 00:09:19.958
audio, video, and photos
that include Giuliani and Trump.

00:09:19.958 --> 00:09:22.128
That's right, they have audio
and video recordings

00:09:22.128 --> 00:09:24.697
of Trump and Rudy.
And let's just spare a thought

00:09:24.697 --> 00:09:26.232
for the Congressional
investigators

00:09:26.232 --> 00:09:29.467
who have to sit down and listen
to recordings of Rudy Giuliani.

00:09:29.467 --> 00:09:31.870
I mean, these are investigators
who probably clerked

00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:34.073
for judges and high-powered
law firms,

00:09:34.073 --> 00:09:35.775
and they'll have to spend
their holiday

00:09:35.775 --> 00:09:37.909
sifting through the ramblings of
this lunatic.

00:09:37.909 --> 00:09:40.346
-Shut up, moron! Shut up.

00:09:40.346 --> 00:09:41.680
-Okay, hold on.
-Shut up. You don't know

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:43.349
what you're talking about.
-We got the whistleblower.

00:09:43.349 --> 00:09:44.750
We have the transcript...
-Shhhh! Shh! Shh!

00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:46.185
-...of the call and the
President's remarks.

00:09:46.185 --> 00:09:48.487
-[ Garbled ] I am Spartacus.
I am Spartacus.

00:09:48.487 --> 00:09:50.189
-By the way, Biden's been off
the trip --

00:09:50.189 --> 00:09:52.691
-He's our Al Gore.

00:09:52.691 --> 00:09:54.826
-Alright, Rudy,
hold that thought.

00:09:54.826 --> 00:09:57.363
-What thought is he gonna hold?

00:09:57.363 --> 00:10:00.332
You know you're crazy when
you're already practicing

00:10:00.332 --> 00:10:03.569
breaking free from your
straightjacket.

00:10:03.569 --> 00:10:06.672
"You'll never hold me!
You'll never hold me!"

00:10:06.672 --> 00:10:09.175
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:10:09.175 --> 00:10:12.178
So now, not only does the House
have possession

00:10:12.178 --> 00:10:15.381
of these recordings, but they've
also subpoenaed Lev and Igor,

00:10:15.381 --> 00:10:17.415
and Democratic Intelligence
Chairman Adam Schiff

00:10:17.415 --> 00:10:18.650
said this week,
"There's a chance

00:10:18.650 --> 00:10:19.919
they'll even be called
to testify."

00:10:19.919 --> 00:10:23.689
-We have subpoenaed documents
from Mr. Parnas.

00:10:23.689 --> 00:10:26.024
We've had discussions with the
Southern District of New York.

00:10:26.024 --> 00:10:29.128
We have subpoenaed Mr. Parnas
and Mr. Fruman

00:10:29.128 --> 00:10:30.529
for their records.

00:10:30.529 --> 00:10:33.532
We would like them to fully
comply with those subpoenas.

00:10:33.532 --> 00:10:36.869
We may go beyond those
documentary requests,

00:10:36.869 --> 00:10:38.537
but we first want to see the
documents,

00:10:38.537 --> 00:10:40.739
and we have seen
time and time again

00:10:40.739 --> 00:10:42.474
the importance of getting
documents

00:10:42.474 --> 00:10:44.143
before witnesses testify.

00:10:44.143 --> 00:10:46.011
It would be nice
to have those documents

00:10:46.011 --> 00:10:48.346
before we question people
like the Secretary of State

00:10:48.346 --> 00:10:50.749
or question people
like Mr. Parnas.

00:10:50.749 --> 00:10:53.485
-Can you imagine this guys
testifying before Congress?

00:10:53.485 --> 00:10:55.220
He'd have to get
special permission

00:10:55.220 --> 00:10:56.856
to wear a tie
with his track suit.

00:10:56.856 --> 00:10:58.691
[ Laughter ]

00:10:58.691 --> 00:11:00.226
The House has laid out
the next steps

00:11:00.226 --> 00:11:01.693
in the impeachment inquiry.
A vote could come

00:11:01.693 --> 00:11:03.529
by the end of the year.
And judging by the polls,

00:11:03.529 --> 00:11:04.830
if Trump does get impeached,

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:06.265
Americans will be doing
a lot of...

00:11:06.265 --> 00:11:07.966
-Thanksgiving.

00:11:07.966 --> 00:11:09.935
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:11:09.935 --> 00:11:13.906
[ Cheers and applause ]

